Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's already December...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:07.39,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The year really flew by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.39,0:00:08.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:10.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Christmas is in December!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:16.28,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Isn't it kinda early...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.78,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What presents should I get everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:23.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll handle the drinks and cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.82,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She really does love these kinds events.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:31.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm curious, Shinozaki-san, do you \Nhave any plans for Christmas Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.79,0:00:36.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's a weekday this year, \Nso I'll probably just be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:38.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:40.74,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I might not have plans, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:44.28,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,if I come to work, I'll get to see \NSenpai, so I won't be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Since her kohai is going to be \Nworking hard on Christmas Day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:53.07,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Santa Senpai is going to have \Nsomething special for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:55.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Make sure to be a good boy until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.26,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:59.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, ho... Ho, ho, ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I don't know why, but I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:07.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.95,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She was so cute my mind completely froze up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:14.35,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry... a-and embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:18.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,N-No, I should be a-apologizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:22.79,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Glance...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:24.18,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Will there be a Santa Hayakawa...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.97,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,There will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.95,0:01:42.71,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:45.79,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.57,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:54.80,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.05,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.10,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:05.59,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.82,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.57,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:17.82,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.40,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:24.11,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:27.32,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:29.82,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:30.63,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:35.43,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.43,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:44.86,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:03:01.24,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,450)\pos(36,310)\an1}#05 {\fscx80}Shall We Go Somewhere Before Heading Home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:02.95,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,And that covers our company's project \Nproposal regarding the Meowtaro collaboration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:05.89,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Did you have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.89,0:03:09.96,Main,Employee from another Company (Male; 30s),0,0,0,,No, that made a lot of \Nsense. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:14.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case, Shinozaki will contact you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:17.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,in regards to nailing down the scheduling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.38,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:21.46,Main,Employee from another Company (Male; 30s),0,0,0,,Right, I'll be waiting to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:26.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm still not used to meeting with clients...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:32.47,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's a different kind of tension \Nfrom having a meeting at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:37.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Still, you were very well-spoken \Ntoday, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:44.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Look, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Isn't that loungewear adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.76,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Bunny ears, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:58.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What do you think? \NI'm your bunny-eared senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:02.49,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It'd definitely be cute if she wore it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I think it'd look great \Non you, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:07.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,On me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.74,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:11.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:14.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Look at the bear-ear hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:18.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's just like that stuffed \Nanimal we won at the arcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:25.61,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wait, w-why am I trying to \Nmake them look alike?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:30.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,In that case, wouldn't this \NShiori-san-looking bunny one be for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,M-Me and Shiori-san...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:37.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.37,Main,Rooster,0,0,0,,Buck buck-kaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:45.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no! Th-That's a terrible idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That bad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a \Nsexually harassing senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:50.52,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,From putting on bunny ears?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:54.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,M-My point is, me wearing \Nthis would be a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:55.77,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:04:57.98,Italics,Both,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.67,Italics,Shiniozaki,0,0,0,,If Senpai put it on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:04.29,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,If Shinozaki-san put it on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:07.29,Italics,Both,0,0,0,,It'd definitely be cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.63,Italics,Both,0,0,0,,I wanna see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.22,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:20.42,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Right there! That lovely couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.13,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:27.88,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I'm a Nya~Tuber, \Nand I've been trying to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.45,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,lovey-dovey stories from couples about town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.92,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,May I borrow some of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.21,Main,Both,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.08,Main,Both,0,0,0,,not a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:44.44,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,I can't believe that, after ten attempts, \NI've still come up empty-handed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:48.33,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Why can't I find a couple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:51.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I'm not sure why, but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:54.41,Main,Cameraman,0,0,0,,I was so sure they were a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:58.26,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,If you're not going out, \Nwhat's your relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We're coworkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.97,Main,Reporters,0,0,0,,Coworkers...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:04.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Right, at the same company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:10.06,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Could one of you confess your feelings\Nright now so you can become involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:11.58,Main,Both,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:15.07,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Why not?! Please, start dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.47,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wha?! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:19.90,Main,reporter,0,0,0,,No! Not until the two of you are a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:22.40,Main,reporter,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! We're at our wits' end!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,C-Cut it out! We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:27.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Please let go! You're going to \Ngive people the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:29.78,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Please! It's just for the Internet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:33.72,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,We've got next to no subscribers! \NWe barely get any views anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.62,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Doesn't it hurt you to say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess we don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:41.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just for a little while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:45.82,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And we're only going to be pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:51.59,Main - Top,Reporter,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! Thank you \Nso, so much! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.88,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Pretending to be dating... Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.38,Main,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Okay, right where you are, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:59.24,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Pretending to be going out... \NSenpai's so mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:01.33,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I must be the only one freaking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:08.84,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,I thought that agreeing to this would be \Neasier than getting her to give up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:12.89,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wh-What do couples even do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HFDFFFE&\an4\bord2\shad0\pos(8,184)}m 0 0 l 225 0 l 225 84 l 0 84
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs28\c&H000000&\an6\bord0\shad0\fsp4\pos(221.334,184)}Never had a\Nboyfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:19.87,Italics - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,If we're a couple, that would mean that \NI'm Shinozaki-san's girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:25.29,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HFDFFFE&\an4\bord2\shad0\pos(17,184)}m 0 0 l 175 0 l 175 84 l 0 84
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:25.29,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs20\c&H000000&\an6\bord0\shad0\fsp4\pos(188,184)}Never had a\Nboyfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:25.29,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HFDFFFE&\an4\bord2\shad0\pos(505,93)}m 0 0 l 122 0 l 122 44 l 0 44
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:25.29,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs20\c&H000000&\an5\bord0\shad0\fsp4\pos(568,93)}Confused
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:23.86,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,In other words, Shinozaki-san \Nis my boyfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:29.18,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,And here we are! \NLet's start with the girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:33.22,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Tell us what you like about your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What I like...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:39.49,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,This is kinda embarrassing, \Nbut I can take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:45.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I like how serious he is, and how he really \Nthrows himself into the tasks he's given.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.64,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,That sounds lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:51.03,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,You two met on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:51.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:55.12,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,So, you must've gotten to know \Neach other while working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:07:59.41,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,This doesn't seem so hard, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:02.09,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Now, next, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.95,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,What was your first kiss like? And where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:10.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Isn't that raising the \Nbar a little suddenly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.41,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Huh? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:16.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We're only pretending to be a couple, \Nso questions that are too probing might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:22.33,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Now, now, just imagine what \Nyou wish it'd be like!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:25.15,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Please? Please? Please...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:27.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,W-Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:33.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It was in the office kitchenette... \Nwhen we were alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:34.94,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The k-kitchenette?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:37.99,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I won't be able to keep me cool \Nnext time I'm in there!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:42.76,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I can't believe I said that! \NIt makes it sound like I'm setting him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.30,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Okay, here's a question for the boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:49.63,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I have to make sure I keep \NSenpai's premise going!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.01,0:08:53.62,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But with my experience, there's gonna be \Nquestions I have no idea how to deal with,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.18,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}on top of being embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:57.39,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\c&HFDFFFE&\an4\bord2\shad0\pos(16,166.667)}m 0 0 l 225 0 l 225 84 l 0 84
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:57.39,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs28\c&H000000&\an6\bord0\shad0\fsp4\pos(229.334,166.667)}Never had a\Ngirlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.90,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.08,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.34,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What I learned at the new employee seminar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:05.89,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,When you need to be flexible in your \Nthinking, pretend to be someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.71,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll be a playboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:10.96,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If I'm pretending to be a \Nplayer instead of myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.82,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I should be able to respond to \Nanything without freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:17.15,Main,Yamagishi (M),0,0,0,,Sup! Hell yeah, I get around! How {\i1}you{\i0} doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.34,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Let's start by hearing what you \Nlike about your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:25.18,Main,Shinozazki,0,0,0,,You wanna know about my current \Nsqueeze? Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.58,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs20\c&H000000&\an5\bord0\shad0\pos(544,47.333)}Possessed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Shinozaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Even being around her is awesome, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:34.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's, like, a miracle we \Nhooked up, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.85,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Sh-Sh-Shinozaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:42.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She's like a ninja with work time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:45.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}The goddess who taught me there's something \Nsweeter than that OT pay, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:45.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\p1\c&HFDFFFE&\an5\bord2\shad0\pos(320,345)}m 0 0 l 510 0 l 510 25 l 0 25
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:45.85,Italics,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs20\c&H000000&\fsp4\an5\bord0\shad0\pos(320,345)}Possessed, but still Shinozaki Inside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:49.18,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,H-He's hugging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.18,0:09:53.97,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess... this is what Shinozaki-san \Nwould do with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:56.99,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,So, what was your first time together like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,F-First—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:01.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It was the second time she came by my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.99,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Th-The second—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:07.41,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The first time would probably be \Ntoo much, even for a playboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:12.18,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,The second time? I've been to \NShinozaki-san's house once before...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:15.50,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,D-Does that mean if I go again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:19.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, you left \Nsomething at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:23.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You came by a second time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:27.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:33.17,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}W-We can't! It's still too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.15,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fscx120\fs20\c&H000000&\an4\bord0\shad0\pos(372,300)}She forgot the basic premise\Nwas pretending to be dating\Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:40.44,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,For him to be able to say something \Nlike this without hesitation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:42.41,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's so shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:54.67,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I like how serious he is, and how he really \Nthrows himself into the tasks he's given.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:58.16,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:05.44,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,He's throwing himself into answering this \Ninterview as seriously as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.80,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, you truly are...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.19,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,a kohai I can be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.31,Main,Reporter,0,0,0,,Let's end with a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:19.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, s-sure, piece of cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:22.12,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Crap, what now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:24.10,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:34.01,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case, as his senpai, \NI need to support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:50.16,Main,Reprter,0,0,0,,Perfect! Thank you so much for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:54.03,Main,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Are these two seriously not dating...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.41,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Time for a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:07.78,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Wonder if there're any interesting videos up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.92,Sign_Basic,screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\fs10\3c&HEDF0EE&\shad0\an4\frz13.68\pos(344,114.666)}Recommended Popular Videos
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.92,Sign_Basic,screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\fs14\3c&HEDF0EE&\shad0\an4\pos(310.667,329.333)\frz14.42\3c&HF6F9F6&}Colleagues! The Couple Next Door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.85,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\an8}What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:19.18,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They said they didn't have \Na lot of subscribers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:22.68,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,And that they never got many views...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.36,Italics,Both,0,0,0,,That's what they said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hey, I saw the video!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.15,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You two are already going out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.94,Main,Both,0,0,0,,We are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:35.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Here's hot coffee, \Nand a warm senpai's cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.57,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-It really is warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:46.91,Main,President,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.90,Main,President,0,0,0,,You've all worked hard again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:53.57,Main,President,0,0,0,,I want you all to enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.75,Main,President,0,0,0,,After all, it's Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:13:00.18,Main,President,0,0,0,,Let's drink to our future success, \Nand to Santa's generosity!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.41,Main,President,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:03.91,Main,President,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.30,Main,Workers,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:10.80,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Oh, Shinozaki-kun, \Nyou're such a Shinozaki-kun....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:11.94,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:19.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:25.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I am, too, so why don't we walk \Nto the station together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:27.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The party was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The food was delicious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:38.83,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.06,Flashback,Akina,0,0,0,,I'm Santa! Ho, ho, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:44.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We got to see a rare managerial Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:47.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,He was really enjoying himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:50.09,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe Senpai will dress \Nlike Santa next year...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:52.87,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.10,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Glorious...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:59.51,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,The whole city's really \Nin Christmas mode, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:01.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:03.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, do you have any plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:11.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,since it's a special occasion, shall we \Ngo somewhere before heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:16.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.21,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What do you think, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's head there next!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:22.88,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:24.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's so soothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:26.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Incredibly cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:32.01,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa... Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:37.94,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This tree's famous, apparently...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:43.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to visit it for a while, \Nbut the chance never really came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:49.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm glad we got to see it \Ntogether, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:53.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:59.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm really happy to spend Christmas \Nwith you like this, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.30,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-So embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:09.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wh-Where do you suppose Santa \Nis flying right about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:13.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It must be really hard delivering presents \Nto kids around the world in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:15.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,True enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:21.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are there any presents you got from \NSanta that you remember, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:23.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Presents...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:27.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let me think... There was \Na video game I wanted once,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.85,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,but then I got the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:35.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But since it was from Santa, \NI tried to enjoy it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:39.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and by the time I was done, \Nit had really grown on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:45.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You were a sweetheart when \Nyou were little, too, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.33,0:15:47.55,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Y-You think...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What about you, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:58.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,One time, I got this cute stuffed cat, \Nand I wanted to have it with me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:04.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I ended up taking it to kindergarten, \Nand my parents received a call about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.73,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And definitely sounds like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:14.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess we haven't changed \Nmuch since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:25.12,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess staying out for so long, \Nit was bound to get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.88,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai! She doesn't have gloves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:33.12,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I should subtly guide \Nher hands into my pockets...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:36.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What a good kohai you are! It's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:41.42,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That might be kinda rude, though, \Nso I should ask first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:43.16,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:46.30,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She had gloves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:48.52,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, well... nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:57.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Huh? Shinozaki-san, \Ndo you not have any gloves?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.95,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:02.12,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But I'll be okay with \Nmy hands in my pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's no good! I've got extras, so here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:08.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:13.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'll make sure \Nto have some ready next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:17.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, I should probably just \Nget some of my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.92,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She just casually made a \Npromise for next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:23.57,Main,Man A,0,0,0,,Ugh, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.45,Main,Man A,0,0,0,,Just like I figured, \Nwe came at the worst time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:28.31,Main,Man B,0,0,0,,Tell me about it. \NCouples, as far as the eye can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:30.25,Main,Man A,0,0,0,,What a drag...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:33.02,Main,Man A,0,0,0,,Will springtime ever come for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:36.71,Main,Man B,0,0,0,,I bet everyone here is gonna \Nhave a great time later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:40.41,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Um, perhaps we should head on home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,G-Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.20,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, but first...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:46.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:48.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The bear loungewear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:52.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When we were heading back from that meeting, \Nwe both thought they looked nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's a Christmas present from your senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:00.84,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I do! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And to be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's the rabbit one, from the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:09.86,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:12.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I guess we were thinking the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something about that makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:22.12,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I thought you would look good \Nin it, and how I'd like to see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:28.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,W-Well, since we traded \Npresents, let's hurry home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We could...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:37.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We could... show each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.52,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wait... you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:41.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:53.95,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Can't believe I left the flash on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:55.58,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'll regret this until the day I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:56.98,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:57.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Manager?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:03.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! How long have \Nyou two been watching?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:06.35,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Well, it was very sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:09.70,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Sweeter than any Christmas \Nor fruitcake I've ever had!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:14.76,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I have to say, Katase-san, you're bolder\N than I figured. I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:20.79,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I mean, considering you discussing showing \Neach other loungewear on Christmas Day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:30.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,N-N-No! Not that! I thought we could send \Neach other pictures of us wearing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:33.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And then... uh... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:39.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We could... exchange contact info, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:45.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Exchange contact info!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:48.15,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:49.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:50.97,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You, too, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:53.05,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Uh, err, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.04,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.17,0:20:00.80,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:02.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hayakawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:05.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:11.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's a white Christmas. How romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:13.95,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Almost seems too convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:17.85,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Let's chalk it up to God bestowing a \Nblessing on hard-working people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:20.71,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That sounds right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:23.41,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Do you think the \Nsnow will pile up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.41,0:20:25.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.48,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,And then we can all \Nmake a snowman together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I like that idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:30.06,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.67,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,What kind of ears would \Nyou want, Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.24,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Why are we talking about ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:44.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:55.14,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,So short...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:58.44,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm a little too old \Nfor this kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.15,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,But it's loungewear, so... \Nit's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:05.41,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Besides, it was a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:17.43,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I shouldn't expect an \Nanswer from a plushie...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:23.67,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But, I think... Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:30.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:50.10,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:55.00,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I still can't bring myself \Nto drink that bitter coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:59.48,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,So I sneakily toss in \Ntwo pinches of a sweet secret
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:03.70,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,And let it slowly spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:08.66,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,There's a local bakery \Nthat's only open sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:13.55,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Where I once had some toast that glittered
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:18.05,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,What is it that makes it so satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.05,0:22:22.22,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Almost like magic
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:27.30,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,I find myself thinking about that kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:32.99,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,How the small things can be the most precious
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:37.70,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Deep inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:42.10,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,It's ever so bittersweet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:47.09,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,"Just being around you is enough"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:51.04,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Becomes my mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.33,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Baby like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:02.66,Italics - Top,,0,0,0,,Baby you're the sugar
